'''Unstarred Alien Enemies''' are one of the two subtypes of [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien Enemies]], the other being [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]. They appear in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[Legend Stages]] and the [[Ranking Dojo]]s.

Their health and damage are initially multiplied by 700%, which can only be negated by obtaining the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]]. Each 100% Treasure reduces this multiplier by 100% (66% reduces it by 66%, 33% by 33%, and so on). They receive no effect from the [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], but [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien Cats]]' abilities work just as well against them as against Starred Aliens.

